<title>MOROCCO: Guinea's President on private visit to Morocco.</title>
<headline>Guinea's President on private visit to Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Lansana Conte arrived in Rabat on Tuesday on a three-day private visit to Morocco, Moroccan news agency MAP said.</p>
<p>MAP said Conte was met at the airport by Justice and Human Rights Minister Abderrahman Amalu.</p>
